sc>eortc</sc> ), 1990<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b57-co13_3p081">57</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;&#x02003;9 flutamide trials</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DiSilverio (Italy), 1990 <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b49-co13_3p081">49</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;&#x02003;5 nilutamide trials</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Williams (U.K.), 1990 <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b58-co13_3p081">58</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;&#x02003;6 <sc>cpa</sc> trials</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Klosterhalfen, 1987 <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b59-co13_3p081">59</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;93% of patients were stage D2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Bennet 1999 <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b23-co13_3p081">23</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Eisenberger (<sc>nci</sc>/<sc>swog</sc>), 1998<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b29-co13_3p081">29</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02003;9 <sc>rct</sc>s included in review</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Zalcberg (Australia), 1996<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b31-co13_3p081">31</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0